# Returning Wood Elemental from the graveyard still requires the entry sacrifice (CR 614.1c).
[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Black Lotus
Animate Dead
Wood Elemental
Forest
Island
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Wood Elemental; Island)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Animate Dead.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Wood Elemental)
Bot1.Choose(Forest)
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Wood Elemental.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Wood Elemental.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest = (absent)
